# Wave W17-U (Route 203): coal sand — coal-road pale sand: a pale sand with sparse coal-dark dust flecks blown across the tread from the Coalseam road (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, Revelry to Coalseam). Split from Route 202’s clean civic sand by the dust itself, and from Route 204’s bluff sand by temperature (smoke-dulled vs scree-bright).
